

[SENTINEZ] edge/v1

=======================================================================

cmd/edge/v1 directory is where you start the edge version 1

```bash
go run cmd/edge/v1/main.go
```

You need TLS certificate to start the app.

For developer, run edge in local, run this command to generate local TLS
certificate with domain `*.sentinez.vn` and `sentinez.vn`, run command at root
of project

```bash
./hack/mkcert-local.sh
```

Add host to `/etc/hosts` if you on Linux
```
127.0.0.1 example.sentinez.vn
127.0.0.1 sentinez.vn
```

If you have not install `mkcert`, please install it.

See: https://github.com/FiloSottile/mkcert 

